	(gr_text "PWR+ = SWITCHED_SYSTEM+ from the external master switch (never raw BAT)   GND = system ground\nESP+ = ESP_SW_BAT+ switched battery to the XIAO BAT pad (NOT 3.3 V)   EGND = ESP32 ground\nA+ = motors 1-3 positive (HAPTIC_3V3_A)   B+ = motors 4-6 positive (HAPTIC_3V3_B)   Mn- = motor n negative\nC7/C8: + pad marked   D1-D6: cathode bar towards the 3.3 V rail   R: 100R gate / 100k pulldown"
		(at 100 101 0)
		(layer "F.Fab")
